@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-login-token
@organizationId = replace-with-organization-id
@propertyId = replace-with-property-id
@listingId = replace-with-listing-id
@imageId = replace-with-image-id
@imagePath = C:/path/to/your/photo.jpg
@imageVersion = 0
@listingVersion = 0
@propertyVersion = 1
@unitVersion = 0

### Upload an existing local JPEG/PNG privately; replace imagePath above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ImageUploadBoundary

--ImageUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< {{imagePath}}
--ImageUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="altText"

Living room
--ImageUploadBoundary--

### Read image metadata/current versions; default excludes archived images
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/images?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### View private image bytes as a member of the owning or delegated organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/images/{{imageId}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update its description; published uses of the old version become hidden
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/images/{{imageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{imageVersion}},"altText":"Bright living room"}

### Select approved images when publishing; always use current source and image versions
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/listings/{{listingId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{listingVersion}},"propertyVersion":{{propertyVersion}},"unitVersion":{{unitVersion}},"images":[{"id":"{{imageId}}","version":{{imageVersion}}}]}

### Guest listing metadata now includes an images array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/listings/{{listingId}}

### Guest image bytes; works only if this image is selected in a currently visible listing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/listings/{{listingId}}/images/{{imageId}}

### Archive privately; use ACTIVE to restore, then review/re-publish the listing
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/images/{{imageId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{imageVersion}},"status":"ARCHIVED"}
